          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EPH.4.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Efeso 4:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Am'omiyo paka wibedo ji pa Were m'oyer, maleŋ aka ma go omaro, onyo bedi win joma ramere ri wadi win, ma winigi cuny maber, bwonirok, mwolo, kodi diyo cuny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EPH.4.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Efeso 4:32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Diy win cuny win gi wadi win, aka cwakere win ka moro kwoŋ win nitie gi kiŋunyaŋunya gi nyawote. Wiripo cwakere paka Rwoth bende otieko cwako win. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "[Aka maloyo meno je, kethi win mar, ma riwo gigipiny je kanyacel i riwirok m'ocowere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Weyi siem pa Kristo, ma olwoŋ'iye win paka adec ma del acel wodhum cuny win; Aka bedi win gi foyo Were]. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EPH.5.19+EPH.5.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Efeso 5:19-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Weyi mikwenda pa Kristo gi ŋaŋo mere je, wobedi i cuny win, munyo wifonjo aka wimedo jowoti win meni gi rieko je, kareno wiwero wer Zabuli, kodi wer ma cuny ka wifoyo Were i cuny win. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gimoro je ma witimo kosa wiwaco, ripo witim i nyingi Rwoth Yesu, munyo wifoyo Were Baba kwoŋ go.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kula ma ripo i pecin kodi i udi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
